elf2e32_next (github.com/fedor4ever/elf2e32_next, EPL-1.0) fixes for GCC 14 symbianelf output:
- imports from ELF files without a symbol version table: map each undefined symbol to its DSO by
  scanning the --libpath .dso files (first DSO wins);
- a missing Symbian$$CPP$$Exception$$Descriptor is not an error (-fno-exceptions code).
Applied by container/Containerfile.modern on top of the commit pinned in sources.lock.

